WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.501 --> 00:00:02.901
-This is a real thing I did
and not a comedy bit.

00:00:02.901 --> 00:00:04.400
Okay. Are you ready?

00:00:04.400 --> 00:00:07.701
I wrote a book called "I'm Not
Scared, YOU'RE Scared."

00:00:07.701 --> 00:00:09.067
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:09.067 --> 00:00:11.567
You can get it wherever you buy
your best-selling books.

00:00:11.567 --> 00:00:15.734
That's right, it landed on the
New York Time's bestseller list.

00:00:15.734 --> 00:00:19.701
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:19.701 --> 00:00:23.167
Was it number one? I think I
would've said so if it was.

00:00:23.167 --> 00:00:26.567
[ Laughter ]

00:00:26.567 --> 00:00:27.868
Think I would've.

00:00:27.868 --> 00:00:29.634
Top three though!

00:00:29.634 --> 00:00:31.267
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:31.267 --> 00:00:35.434
You know what that means,
wasn't number two either.

00:00:35.434 --> 00:00:39.234
[ Laughter ]

00:00:39.234 --> 00:00:41.100
It's a great book
to read to your kids.

00:00:41.100 --> 00:00:43.634
Or it makes an excellent book
for your friends who have kids.

